2 CONT March 1670, serving the new colony at Ashley River as interpreter and Indian
2 CONT agent. Married Mrs. Mary Browne, widow of Robert Browne and daughter of Col.
2 CONT John Godfrey. Sons John (b. 1681) and Richard (b. 1683), daughter Elizabeth.
