1 TITL Obituary of Joan Liebes Hutson (1931-2026)
1 AUTH The Dallas Morning News (via Legacy.com)
1 PUBL obits.dallasnews.com, January 2026
1 _URL https://obits.dallasnews.com/us/obituaries/dallasmorningnews/name/joan-hutson-obituary?id=60625475
1 _CONF Secondary
1 _ACC 2026-09-23
1 NOTE Full obituary. The page itself is behind a bot check, so its content was read
2 CONT via search-engine extracts: "Joan Liebes Hutson, 94, of Dallas, Texas, passed
2 CONT away peacefully on January 13, 2026. Born in Portland, Oregon, Joan spent her
2 CONT early childhood in San Francisco before moving to Dallas at age eleven. She
2 CONT was the daughter of George and Edith Liebes and the beloved sister of George
2 CONT 'Sonny' Liebes. She earned degrees from Southern Methodist University and
2 CONT Stanford University, began her career as a schoolteacher, and later worked in
2 CONT Personnel and Training at Neiman Marcus." Survivors: children John Charles
2 CONT Hutson, Paul Neil Hutson, Mary Louise Hutson Suttles; grandchildren Miles,
2 CONT Jenni, Zachary, Sydnie, Casey, Shelley, Carter and Cole.
