1 NOTE 5x-great-grandfather of Miles; "for years the patriarch of the city of
2 CONT Charleston." Left Falmouth in 1770, found religion in New York, and followed
2 CONT Rev. William Tennent to Charleston's Circular Church in 1772 - the same
2 CONT church Rev. William Hutson had led in 1757-61. Clerk and sexton there for
2 CONT 39 years, succeeded by his son Edward. Married Sarah Morgan of Bermuda on
2 CONT 23 Oct 1774; father of sixteen children, including the Rev. Benjamin Morgan
2 CONT Palmer Sr. and Rev. Edward Palmer. Wrote a memoir for his descendants at 93.
2 SOUR @S39@
3 _CONF Secondary
