1 NOTE Family history of the Palmers, drawing on tombstones, C. W. Jenkins's History
2 CONT of Falmouth (1843), and the manuscript memoir Job Palmer wrote for his
2 CONT descendants at 93. Covers Rev. Thomas Palmer (1665-1743) -> Rev. Samuel
2 CONT Palmer (1707-1775) -> Job Palmer (1747-1845) -> Rev. Edward Palmer
2 CONT (1788-1882), and Sarah Bunce, daughter of Capt. Jared Bunce. Quotes Prof.
2 CONT Charles Woodward Hutson, "a nephew." The author explicitly declines to fix
2 CONT the generations between Rev. Thomas and the 1621 immigrant William Palmer.
