1 NOTE 7x-great-grandfather of Miles; a French Huguenot refugee. Followed his
2 CONT father Jacob to Amsterdam after the Revocation of the Edict of Nantes;
2 CONT received into the Walloon-French church there 28 Jan 1691; married Susanne
2 CONT Rochet there 13 July 1692; moved to London in 1701 (his wife joined the
2 CONT Threadneedle Street Huguenot church in 1702), and by 1705 was at the Huguenot
2 CONT settlement of Manakin Towne, Henrico County, Virginia. Thirteen children.
