1 NOTE 6x-great-grandmother of Miles; daughter of Joseph Jones. At her daughter
2 CONT Milicent's baptism (1769) the sponsors were "her grand-uncle Miles Brewton and
2 CONT her grand aunts Mrs Frances (Brewton) Pinckney and Mrs. Elizabeth (Brewton)
2 CONT Milner." Those Brewtons were her mother's siblings: her mother was Mary
2 CONT Brewton (b. 1720), daughter of Col. Robert Brewton and granddaughter of the
2 CONT immigrant Col. Miles Brewton. This is how the name "Miles Brewton" entered
2 CONT the family, to reappear in Miles Brewton Hutson (1889) and Miles Hutson (1993).
2 CONT Her will was made in 1835 and proved in 1839.
