1 NOTE 7x-great-grandfather of Miles; "the founder of a family conspicuous in the
2 CONT history of South Carolina." A sea captain trading between Charles Town,
2 CONT London and Providence; in 1733 he rescued survivors of the wrecked Spanish
2 CONT treasure fleet and was himself detained at Havana, returning with the first
2 CONT warning of a planned Spanish attack on Port Royal. Married Deborah Milner in
2 CONT Charles Town on 13 July 1732; later a merchant and, from 1756, a justice of
2 CONT the peace.
