2 CONT wife of Joseph Jones"; Col. Robert Brewton (1698-1759); "8. Mary Brewton
2 CONT [Robert 2, Miles 1], b. Nov. 3, 1720; m., Jan 6, 1742, Joseph Jones. Issue:
2 CONT i. John Jones, killed at Savannah Oct. 9, 1779. ii. Milicent Jones, m., Oct.
2 CONT 30, 1768, John Colcock."
