2 CONT county wills and deeds, plus Gen. Green Clay's manuscript family history (c.
2 CONT 1820). Gives Charles Clay (d. by 1686) and Hannah Wilson -> Henry Clay
2 CONT (c. 1672-1760) and Mary Mitchell -> Charles Clay (1716-1789) and Martha Green
2 CONT (1719-1793) -> "Mary Clay, born September 22, 1742; married Stephen
2 CONT Lockett." Green/Marston ancestry of Martha Green from the Green Clay
2 CONT manuscript.
