2 CONT have married Benjamin Watkins, of Chesterfield Co., Va., and had numerous
2 CONT descendants." Recorded only as a lead because it does not settle which
2 CONT Elizabeth Cary was Miles's ancestor. See also Fairfax Harrison, The Virginia
2 CONT Carys (1919).
